You're not the only one! There was a discussion on [CODE] comp.lang.python [/CODE] about this a while ago, and a recipe was created. Check it out here . [CODE] """
doc_inherit decorator

Usage:

class Foo(object):
    def foo(self):
        "Frobber"
        pass

class Bar(Foo):
    @doc_inherit
    def foo(self):
        pass 

Now, Bar.foo.__doc__ == Bar().foo.__doc__ == Foo.foo.__doc__ == "Frobber"
