Answer: Here is the issue: You cannot have a cookie which key contains either the character '[' or ']' I discovered the solution following @Todor's link , then I found out about this SO post . Basically there was a bug in python 2.7.x that does not parse cookies with ']' in the value. The bug was fixed in 2.7.10. I thought it would be good to just confirm this issue. So I dug through all of the cookies and found one with the following key/value: [CODE] key: BDRCVFR[feWj1Vr5u3D]
val: I67x6TjHwwYf0
