pymongo: findandmodify - "no such command" is returned I believe there is a bug in pymongo (or, at least, the documentation) which makes it impossible to run a [CODE] findandupdate [/CODE] query. Here's what happens. When I run: [CODE]     result = db.command({
        'findandmodify': 'my_collection',
