Answer: For languages that don't have a built-in sorted dict type the mongo drivers include one. In python that is the SON type: http://api.mongodb.org/python/1.4%2B/api/pymongo/son.html . You will need to use that for all commands. If that still fails make sure you are using the latest version of the database as findandmodify is a new feature.

