 [/CODE] Is this representation correct using python list? Can I avoid empty list [CODE] [] [/CODE] in this representation?

Answer: It depends on what you mean by 'represent'. You can represent trees by just having the elements in a list e.g. list = [40,25,78,10,32,50,93,3,17,30,38] Then to iterate through it if you want to recreate the tree you can iterate through the list since you know that the life child of list[(i+1)*2-1] and the right child is list[(i+1)*2]. Note: you have to do i+1 since the first element has index 0, And I is the index of the parent node, e.g. the index+1 of the of 25 is 2 therefore the index+1 of 25's left child is 4.

