        say "Invalid line";
    }

}
 [/CODE] The problem is that I've been corrupted by Perl, so I think the easiest way to do something is to use a regular expression. Here's the code I have so far... [CODE]  for line in file_handle:
     line = line.strip

     # Comment lines and blank lines
     if line.find("#") == 1 \
