question:
Is there a django template equivalent of the python string multiplication function? In python I can write [CODE] "Hello" * 5 [/CODE] and get [CODE] HelloHelloHelloHelloHello
 [/CODE] Is there a way to do this in a django template? Something like [CODE] {% multiply "Hello" 5 %} [/CODE] or as a filter [CODE] {% "Hello"|multiply:"5" %} [/CODE] Or maybe a "repeat" loop control? Something like: [CODE] {% repeat 5 %}
Hello
{% endrepeat %}
 [/CODE] I can write a filter or tag myself, but was wondering if I could save myself some trouble. If someone can authoritatively say that there is no built-in capability such as I require, that would be a perfectly acceptable answer.

answer:
Here's another hack: [CODE] {% for x in ""|ljust:"100" %}
    Hello World!
{% endfor %}
 [/CODE] I'm using an empty string as the value here, and I repeat the thing 100x. You can also use a variable to determine the number of repeats with this hack :) just replace "100" with the variable. [CODE] {% for x in ""|ljust:repeat_count %}
    Hello World!
{% endfor %}
 [/CODE] Or make your own... you can make the multiply filter quite easily ( more on making your own template tags and filters ): In an installed app (e.g., included in your INSTALLED_APPS setting), add a "templatetags" module and a file called "string_multiply.py" So you will have something like this: [CODE] your_app
  + templatetags
  | + __init__.py
  | + string_multiply.py 
  + __init__.py
  + models.py
 [/CODE] plus whatever else you have in your app... Here's your string_multiply.py [CODE] from django.template import Library

register = Library()

@register.filter
def multiply(string, times):
    return string * times
 [/CODE] Yup that's the whole thing... And then in your template [CODE] {% load string_multiply %}

Chris Brown:
{% filter multiply:3 %}
  Yeah!
{% endfilter %}

You (x5):
{{ request.user.username|multiply:5 }}
 [/CODE] The output of which will be: [CODE] Chris Brown:
  Yeah!
  Yeah! 
  Yeah!

You (x5):
Koliber ServicesKoliber ServicesKoliber ServicesKoliber ServicesKoliber Services
 [/CODE]

