    while True:
        yield mac_address
 [/CODE] The [CODE] while True [/CODE] loop obviously makes them blocking. I want to use [CODE] asyncore [/CODE] for this as it is part of the standard library. No 3rd party dependencies are a bonus. However, that doesn't mean I won't use it if you recommend I do... Can I achieve what I'm trying to do with asyncore? If so, could you show me how to convert my example code to 'asyncore code'? Do you know of any good asyncore tutorials?

